{"title":"Citadel Contemporary Dance:  Winterreise","startsAt":"2026-11-28T19:30:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-28T21:30:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"### Winterreise\n\n##### Laurence Lemieux & Citadel \\+ Compagnie \\| Echo Chamber\n\nA solitary traveller wanders through a frozen world of memory and longing in this **moving adaptation of Franz Schubert’s *Winterreise*.** Reimagined for violin, piano, and two voices, the production intertwines live music and dance to explore love, loss, and the search for belonging in Schubert’s timeless song cycle.\n\n***Ticket link here: ($35-$45)***\n\n(you're purchasing for the Saturday November 28th--8pm\n\nhttps://www.citadelcie.com/event/winterreise/\n\nMore info on Echo Chamber:\n\nhttps://www.echochambertoronto.com/\n\nJoin us for this 'winter journey'!!","venue":{"name":"The Citadel (The Ross Centre for Dance / Citadel + Compagnie)","address":"304 Parliament St., Lower Studio, Toronto","lat":43.659107,"lng":-79.366013,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/2/6/a/3/highres_451449891.jpeg"}